  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORDEM &#x2013; Support to Stabilisation objectives in DRC (UNDP and MONUSCO)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seconds international experts to wrok with national and international authorities to strengthen their capacities to handle conflicts, to plan and implement democratic elections and to promote good governance, democratic processes, human rights and the principles of rules of law in focal countries, countries with large UN- and EU-operations and in the OSSE region. Deployments MONUSCO</narrative>
  </description>
